{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43603","headline":"游长安诸寺联句 宣阳坊静域寺 三阶院联句 · 段成式","name":"游长安诸寺联句 宣阳坊静域寺 三阶院联句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"密密助堂堂，隋人歌檿桑。\n双弧摧孔雀，一矢陨贪狼。\n百步望云立，九规看月张。\n获蛟徒破浪，中乙漫如墙。\n还似贯金鼓，更疑穿石梁。\n因添挽河力，爲灭射天狂。\n绝艺却南牧，英声来鬼方。\n丽龟何足敌，殪豕未爲长。\n龙臂胜猨臂，星芒超箭芒。\n虚夸绝高鸟，垂拱议明堂。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"段成式","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43603.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43603","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}